00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.1 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Your legal and regulatory map

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know the legal duties you will carry, and ask the right questions before you launch.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Map duties from your form, activities, countries and funders.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Note which duties start before you register or first hire.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Mark what someone with a legal background has confirmed.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You build your legal map and a list of open legal questions.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
